:expect-pins 7
# Fresh-process temporal case TA-37.

# The active lease must rejoin the exact judgment-basis witness.
? correct(Case_Adam, ActivePower).
# => FALSE

# The case-record status currently covers subject and holder, not judgment basis.
? match(Adam, CaseRecorded).
# => TRUE

# The substantive conviction record requires both JudgmentScope witnesses.
? match(Adam, ConvictionRecorded).
# => FALSE

# The Court gate fails closed when one judgment witness is missing.
? prisoner(Adam).
# => FALSE

# Liberty is not conditioned on supplying the missing basis.
? travel(Adam).
# => TRUE

# The raw inactive lease derives a lease-scoped record error.
? err(Case_Adam, TemporalRecord).
# => TRUE

# The incomplete conviction basis separately derives a person-facing authority error.
? err(Adam, TemporalAuthority).
# => TRUE
